    {
      "_comment":[
        "Bonds Description:",
        "Bonds are optional checks to be added for a bit of fun extra mini goals to aim for.",
        "The toons named in a bond must all be found on the same floor in any combination of twisteds and toons, with ",
        "the requirement that the player must be playing as one of them.",
        "Once such a floor is completed, the check can then be obtained."
      ]
    },
